{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 35,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        42.276031494140625,
        171.74810791015625,
        51.276031494140625
      ],
      "text": "Remark 2",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        54.276031494140625,
        408.2228088378906,
        63.276031494140625
      ],
      "text": "Accurate identiﬁcation of an index patient with MDR-TB or XDR-TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.09010314941406,
        66.27304077148438,
        408.2227478027344,
        75.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "requires that drug susceptibility testing be available and used. Even",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.09010314941406,
        78.27005004882812,
        408.2411193847656,
        87.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "when such testing is available, several weeks are required to determine",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.11709594726562,
        90.26705932617188,
        408.53765869140625,
        99.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "susceptibility or resistance. Thus, for the purpose of contact investigation,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.9730987548828,
        102.26406860351562,
        408.2319030761719,
        111.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "suspected cases of MDR-TB or XDR-TB should be considered in the same",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.10809326171875,
        114.26107788085938,
        408.1990661621094,
        123.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "way as those with proven MDR-TB or XDR-TB. Identiﬁcation of the index",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.06610107421875,
        126.27304077148438,
        408.1629333496094,
        135.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "case suspected of having MDR-TB and XDR-TB will depend on the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0391082763672,
        138.27005004882812,
        408.1988525390625,
        147.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "individual circumstances and factors related to the region and health",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.06610107421875,
        150.26705932617188,
        408.2169494628906,
        159.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "service in which the individual lives or was treated. An index patient is",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0841064453125,
        162.26406860351562,
        408.3515319824219,
        171.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "more likely to have MDR-TB or XDR-TB in a region that it is known to",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.2281036376953,
        174.26107788085938,
        408.36077880859375,
        183.26107788085938
      ],
      "text": "have a high background rate from representative drug susceptibility",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.2281036376953,
        186.25808715820312,
        408.180908203125,
        195.27609252929688
      ],
      "text": "testing. The likelihood that a patient has MDR-TB or XDR-TB after failing",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.04812622070312,
        198.27310180664062,
        408.36090087890625,
        207.27310180664062
      ],
      "text": "an initial standardized treatment regimen has been shown to be highly",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.22811889648438,
        210.27001953125,
        408.395263671875,
        219.27011108398438
      ],
      "text": "variable but deﬁnitely increased. The proportion of cases with MDR-TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.2624053955078,
        222.26702880859375,
        408.5396423339844,
        231.26702880859375
      ],
      "text": "or XDR-TB among patients who fail standardized re-treatment regimens",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.40640258789062,
        234.2640380859375,
        408.4765319824219,
        243.2640380859375
      ],
      "text": "is also variable but generally higher (65–89%) than the proportion of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.35240173339844,
        246.26104736328125,
        408.3051452636719,
        255.26104736328125
      ],
      "text": "those failing initial regimens (34). Index patients who are chronically",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1724090576172,
        258.258056640625,
        343.6724853515625,
        267.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "smear positive nearly always have MDR-TB or XDR-TB.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0784912109375,
        288.2728576660156,
        171.58349609375,
        297.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "Remark 3",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        300.27606201171875,
        349.3901062011719,
        309.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "Different rationales apply to each of the four priorities:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.07211303710938,
        318.27606201171875,
        408.2137145996094,
        327.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "• As, with few exceptions, only patients with pulmonary TB can",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.58612060546875,
        330.1368103027344,
        408.22296142578125,
        339.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis transmit   and because people with a positive sputum",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.6041259765625,
        342.27008056640625,
        408.2769775390625,
        351.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "smear by microscopy are more infectious than people with negative",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.6581268310547,
        354.26708984375,
        408.322021484375,
        363.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "smears, contact investigation should generally be limited to new or",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.703125,
        366.26409912109375,
        346.42901611328125,
        375.26409912109375
      ],
      "text": "recurrent cases with positive sputum smears (32,33).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.20712280273438,
        384.26409912109375,
        408.2139587402344,
        393.2731018066406
      ],
      "text": "• It is not known whether MDR-TB and XDR-TB organisms are more",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.59512329101562,
        396.2701110839844,
        408.2206115722656,
        405.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "infectious or pathogenic; however, commonly, index cases who were",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.6016845703125,
        408.26995849609375,
        408.40924072265625,
        417.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "initially treated with ineffective therapy are infectious for a longer",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.78167724609375,
        420.2669677734375,
        408.4634704589844,
        429.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "time and thus their contacts will be more likely to have been infected",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.8446807861328,
        432.26397705078125,
        408.49932861328125,
        441.26397705078125
      ],
      "text": "with these organisms. Contact investigation can potentially result in",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.87167358398438,
        444.2609558105469,
        408.9857482910156,
        453.2609558105469
      ],
      "text": "earlier diagnosis, and appropriate treatment can be started sooner,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.9166717529297,
        456.2579650878906,
        408.09478759765625,
        465.2759704589844
      ],
      "text": "thus possibly minimizing the severity and decreasing transmission",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.45765686035156,
        468.2724304199219,
        161.80270385742188,
        477.2729797363281
      ],
      "text": "(35).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.9547119140625,
        486.2724304199219,
        407.8358154296875,
        495.2724304199219
      ],
      "text": "• When an index case is a PLHIV, there is a greater likelihood that people",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.2077178955078,
        498.2694396972656,
        407.7184143066406,
        507.2694396972656
      ],
      "text": "living in the same household also have HIV infection and are at great",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.2167205810547,
        510.2664489746094,
        328.89666748046875,
        519.2664794921875
      ],
      "text": "risk for the development of active TB if infected.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.72071838378906,
        528.2664794921875,
        408.1058654785156,
        537.2664794921875
      ],
      "text": "• Generally, children do not have highly infectious forms of TB; however,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.04571533203125,
        538.1441650390625,
        407.5472717285156,
        549.2634887695312
      ],
      "text": "< when a child   5 years of age develops TB, it is likely that the infection",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        143.9197235107422,
        552.2604370117188,
        408.1865234375,
        561.2784423828125
      ],
      "text": "was acquired from a person in the household. The rationale for",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.5677490234375,
        562.151611328125,
        408.25372314453125,
        573.2754516601562
      ],
      "text": "< assigning high priority to contacts of index cases   5 years of age is",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.61671447753906,
        576.2680053710938,
        408.24456787109375,
        585.2680053710938
      ],
      "text": "to ﬁnd the source of the infection, not to ﬁnd secondary cases from",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        144.62571716308594,
        588.2649536132812,
        181.9577178955078,
        597.2649536132812
      ],
      "text": "the child.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        226.15650939941406,
        651.97265625,
        233.05650329589844,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "33",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}